OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloudy
OL,6,Fwith light rain possible on Friday
OL,7,Fbefore things turn drier and brighter
OL,8,Ffrom Saturday. Some showery rain may
OL,9,Fdevelop Sunday.
